Global correctness: transfer-without-basis (run 1).
A full transfer carries the known source basis when the destination omits its
lot cost, so the destination gain is measured against that basis.

========== CLI ==========

ledlight unrealized-gains --to 2024-03-31 --format json <<'LEDGER'
commodity USD
  format 1,000.00 USD
  default
commodity FUND
  format 1,000.000 FUND
account Assets:Bank
account Assets:Broker
account Assets:OtherBroker

P 2024-03-01 FUND 120 USD

2024-01-01 Purchase
  Assets:Broker  10 FUND {100 USD}
  Assets:Bank  -1000 USD

2024-02-01 Transfer with missing destination basis
  Assets:Broker  -10 FUND {100 USD}
  Assets:OtherBroker  10 FUND
LEDGER

========== OUTPUT ==========

[
  {
    "account": "Assets:OtherBroker",
    "quantity": "200",
    "commodity": "USD"
  }
]

========== WARNINGS ==========
